  "description": "ORUZOT crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H84 N12 O22 Yb4,8(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.486-3.773 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.36-111.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C120H108N20O22Yb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
